{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107896","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107896/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107896/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107896/events","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/107896","id":3168643910,"node_id":"I_kwDOAO6SJc683atG","number":107896,"title":"XCode build errors from Godot 4.5-beta1 exported project","user":{"login":"owlnewworlds","id":156072785,"node_id":"U_kgDOCU17UQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/156072785?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/owlnewworlds","html_url":"https://github.com/owlnewworlds","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/owlnewworlds/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/owlnewworlds/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/owlnewworlds/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/owlnewworlds/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/owlnewworlds/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/owlnewworlds/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/owlnewworlds/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/owlnewworlds/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/owlnewworlds/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":279096997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTY5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/archived","name":"archived","color":"aaaaaa","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279097519,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTc1MTk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/platform:ios","name":"platform:ios","color":"e4e4e4","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":307135532,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwzMDcxMzU1MzI=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:plugin","name":"topic:plugin","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":12,"created_at":"2025-06-23T15:40:27Z","updated_at":"2026-01-06T12:08:54Z","closed_at":"2026-01-06T12:08:38Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n- Reproducible with Godot 4.5 beta1\n- Not reproducible with Godot 4.4.1 release\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.5.beta1 - macOS Sequoia (15.3.1) - Multi-window, 1 monitor - Metal (Mobile) - integrated Apple M3 Pro (Apple9) - Apple M3 Pro (12 threads) - 18.00 Gio memory\n\n### Issue description\n\nWhen opening and building a game project exported from Godot 4.5 beta1 version, some errors occur and these errors weren't there before (meaning in Godot 4.4.1 stable release). All these errors are happening because of different plugins used in the project.\n\nI'm putting it here because since it seems to occur with each plugin in some way, it must be tied to Godot 4.5 itself. But maybe I'm wrong!\n\nErrors with Godot iOS plugins\n<img width=\"608\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/1429b005-aebb-4d50-b669-aad42e740e5f\" />\n\nErrors with Bytebrew plugin\n<img width=\"626\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/0ff16087-c360-4c8b-b056-7f72bb912acd\" />\n\nErrors with AdMob\n<img width=\"612\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/0bda204c-3a00-4521-a15c-1d2e6ebc92ff\" />\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n- Create an empty game project with Godot 4.5-beta1 and export it to iOS\n- Add the plugins either from Bytebrew, the official Godot iOS plugins (GameCenter here) or AdMob from Point Studios\n- Open XCode and build the project\n- Some errors prevent the project from building (only with Godot 4.5 beta1)\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nYou can enable / disable the different plugins when exporting to iOS and see the different results once the project opened into XCode\n[test-github.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/20868757/test-github.zip)\n\nI think any of the plugin will help point to a possible global problem with this version? But if you really want to test with the AdMob plugin, a little extra about testing the AdMob plugin:\n\n<img width=\"864\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/4e6ef6c8-047c-43d2-a3f9-1a666c6e96b8\" />\n\nThe pod files must be added as \"Do not embed\"","closed_by":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107896/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"